msgstr "所有速度都按 %(working)s 个 token 的上下文计算，这样每一行才可比；上下文列给出的是每个候选能容纳的最大长度。按 %(use_case)s、%(requested)s 个 token 估算大小并评分。"

msgid "Speeds are for %(working)s tokens of context so every row compares like with like; the context column is the largest each one holds. Sized for %(planned)s tokens and scored for %(use_case)s against %(requested)s."
msgstr "所有速度都按 %(working)s 个 token 的上下文计算，这样每一行才可比；上下文列给出的是每个候选能容纳的最大长度。按 %(planned)s 个 token 估算大小，并按 %(use_case)s 对照 %(requested)s 评分。"

